# Cloudflare Pages redirects

# /install redirects to the install section of the website
/install    /#installation    301
/install/   /#installation    301

# /docs redirect to GitHub documentation as fallback
/docs       https://github.com/dismonjames/UniLume/tree/main/docs    302
/docs/*     https://github.com/dismonjames/UniLume/tree/main/docs/:splat    302

# Legacy path support
/downloads/*     /pool/:splat    301
